{"seq":1,"slug":"learning-methodology","title":"学习方法论","stage":"DONE","category":"learning","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 学习方法论 简介\n\n学习是人类最底层的能力之一，却很少有人系统地学习过\"如何学习\"。我们花费大量时间学习具体的知识和技能——编程语言、框架、算法——但几乎从未停下来审视学习这件事本身。事实上，学习方法论的差异，往往比天赋和努力更能解释人与人之间的能力差距。一个掌握了科学学习方法的人，能够在同样的时间投入下，获得数倍于他人的成长速度和知识质量。\n\n本知识库面向所有希望提升学习效率的知识工作者和终身学习者。无论你是刚入行的初级开发者，还是已有多年经验但感觉成长瓶颈的资深工程师，这里都将为你提供从认知科学到实战技巧的完整学习方法论体系。\n\n全书共分六个章节：\n\n第一章**学习科学**从大脑如何学习出发，深入神经可塑性、记忆机制、认知负荷和动机心理学，为你建立理解一切学习方法的科学基础。\n\n第二章**元认知**聚焦\"学会学习\"这一核心能力，探讨自我觉察、计划监控评估、成长型思维和反思实践，帮助你成为自己学习过程的主动驾驭者。\n\n第三章**技能习得模型**梳理从新手到专家的进阶路径，涵盖 Dreyfus 模型、布鲁姆分类法、Kolb 学习圈和最近发展区理论，让你精确定位自己的学习阶段并选择匹配的学习策略。\n\n第四章**构建学习体系**将零散的学习方法整合为系统化的学习实践，包括个人课程设计、学习日志、问责系统和学习社群，打造一套可持续运转的学习引擎。\n\n第五章**知识迁移**探索如何将一个领域的知识应用到另一个领域，通过类比思维、跨领域迁移、以教促学和写作学习，实现知识的乘数效应。\n\n第六章**学新技术剧本**将前五章的理论浓缩为可直接执行的实战指南，提供 30 天学习框架、项目驱动学习、源码阅读和心智模型构建的具体方法。\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读。前三章建立认知科学和学习理论的基础，第四章搭建个人学习系统，第五章拓展知识应用边界，第六章落地为具体的行动方案。如果你急于上手，可以先跳到第六章获取实操指南，再回头补充理论基础。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"learning-science","title":"学习科学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learning-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"how-brain-learns","title":"How Brain Learns 大脑学习机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learning-science/how-brain-learns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-and-forgetting","title":"Memory And Forgetting 记忆与遗忘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learning-science/memory-and-forgetting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cognitive-load-theory","title":"Cognitive Load Theory 认知负荷理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learning-science/cognitive-load-theory"},{"seq":4,"slug":"motivation-and-flow","title":"Motivation And Flow 动机与心流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learning-science/motivation-and-flow"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"metacognition","title":"元认知","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/metacognition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-awareness-in-learning","title":"Self Awareness In Learning 学习自我觉察","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/metacognition/self-awareness-in-learning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"planning-monitoring-evaluating","title":"Planning Monitoring Evaluating 计划监控与评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/metacognition/planning-monitoring-evaluating"},{"seq":3,"slug":"growth-mindset","title":"Growth Mindset 成长型思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/metacognition/growth-mindset"},{"seq":4,"slug":"reflection-practices","title":"反思实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/metacognition/reflection-practices"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"skill-acquisition-models","title":"技能习得模型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/skill-acquisition-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dreyfus-model","title":"德雷福斯模型 (Dreyfus Model)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/skill-acquisition-models/dreyfus-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bloom-taxonomy","title":"布鲁姆分类学 (Bloom Taxonomy)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/skill-acquisition-models/bloom-taxonomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"kolb-learning-cycle","title":"科尔布学习循环 (Kolb Learning Cycle)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/skill-acquisition-models/kolb-learning-cycle"},{"seq":4,"slug":"zone-of-proximal-development","title":"最近发展区 (Zone of Proximal Development)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/skill-acquisition-models/zone-of-proximal-development"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"building-learning-system","title":"构建学习体系","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/building-learning-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"personal-curriculum-design","title":"个人学习课程设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/building-learning-system/personal-curriculum-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"learning-journal","title":"学习日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/building-learning-system/learning-journal"},{"seq":3,"slug":"accountability-systems","title":"学习问责系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/building-learning-system/accountability-systems"},{"seq":4,"slug":"learning-community","title":"学习社群","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/building-learning-system/learning-community"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"knowledge-transfer","title":"知识迁移","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/knowledge-transfer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analogical-thinking","title":"类比思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/knowledge-transfer/analogical-thinking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-domain-transfer","title":"跨领域知识迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/knowledge-transfer/cross-domain-transfer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"teaching-as-learning","title":"以教促学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/knowledge-transfer/teaching-as-learning"},{"seq":4,"slug":"writing-to-learn","title":"写作即学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/knowledge-transfer/writing-to-learn"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"learn-new-tech-playbook","title":"学新技术剧本","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learn-new-tech-playbook","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"day-framework","title":"三十天学习框架 (30-Day Framework)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learn-new-tech-playbook/day-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"project-based-learning","title":"项目式学习 (Project-Based Learning)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learn-new-tech-playbook/project-based-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reading-source-code","title":"阅读源代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learn-new-tech-playbook/reading-source-code"},{"seq":4,"slug":"building-mental-models","title":"构建心智模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-methodology/learn-new-tech-playbook/building-mental-models"}]}]}